## 📊 8. Types of Subqueries — Quick Comparison

| Type | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Single-row | Returns one row |
| Multiple-row | Returns multiple rows |
| Multiple-column | Returns multiple columns |
| Correlated | Depends on the outer query |

**Note:** These categories describe different aspects of subqueries; they are not mutually exclusive.

