## 🎯 9. Important SQL Operators

| Operator | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `IN` | Matches any value in a list or subquery result |
| `EXISTS` | Checks whether the subquery returns at least one row |
| `ANY` | Compares a value with at least one returned value |
| `ALL` | Compares a value with every returned value |
| `=` | Checks equality |
| `>` | Checks whether a value is greater than another value |

